  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3701.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-03-14",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3701.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the procedure to disburse money from the default bench warrant fund to pay the costs related to law enforcement officials who make arrests pursuant to bench warrants for persons improperly at large for driving related offenses.\n\nSource. #5485, eff 10-14-92; ss by #6855, INTERIM, eff 10-14-98, EXPIRES: 2-11-99; ss by #6890, eff 1-1-99; ss by #8665, eff 6-19-06, EXPIRED: 6-19-14\n\nNew. #11175, INTERIM, eff 9-15-16, EXPIRES: 3-14-17; ss by #12120, eff 2-23-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3700.html"
